msgstr "Betalning från"

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php CRM/Member/Form/MembershipRenewal.php
msgid "Send Confirmation and Receipt?"
msgstr "Sänd bekräftelse och kvitto?"

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Select at most one option associated with the same membership type."
msgstr "Välj på det mesta alternativet i samband med samma medlemstyp."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Select at least one membership option."
msgstr "Välj åtminstone ett medlemskapsalterativ"

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Record Membership Payment is required when you use a price set."
msgstr "Rekordmedlemskapsbetalning krävs när du använder en prissättning."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Please select a membership type."
msgstr "Vänligen välj medlemskapstyp."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Please enter an integer for the number of terms."
msgstr "Ange ett heltal för antalet villkor."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php CRM/Member/Form/MembershipType.php
msgid "Please enter the financial Type."
msgstr "Ange finansiell typ."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"Please do not select more than one membership associated with the same "
"organization."
msgstr "Vänligen välj inte mer än ett medlemskap i samband med samma organisation."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Please Select a Soft Credit Type"
msgstr "Vänligen välj en mjuk kredittyp"

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Please select a contact"
msgstr "Välj en kontakt"

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Start date must be the same or later than Member since."
msgstr "Startdatum måste vara detsamma eller senare än medlemmen sedan dess."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"A current lifetime membership cannot have an end date. You can either remove"
" the end date or change the status to a non-current status like Cancelled, "
"Expired, or Deceased."
msgstr "Ett aktuellt livstidsmedlemskap kan inte ha ett slutdatum. Du kan antingen ta bort slutdatumet eller ändra statusen till en icke-aktuell status som Avbruten, Utgången eller Avliden."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"Because you set an End Date for a lifetime membership, This must be set to "
"\"Override Permanently\""
msgstr "Eftersom du ställer in ett slutdatum för ett livstidsmedlemskap måste detta ställas in på \"Override Permanently\""

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Start date must be set if end date is set."
msgstr "Startdatum måste väljas om slutdatum är angivet"

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "End date must be the same or later than start date."
msgstr "Slutdatum måste vara samma eller senare än startdatum."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"There is no valid Membership Status available for selected membership dates."
msgstr "Det finns ingen giltig medlemsstatus tillgänglig för utvalda medlemsdatum."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"Oops, it looks like there is no valid membership status available for the "
"given membership dates. You can <a href=\"%1\">Configure Membership Status "
"Rules</a>."
msgstr "Oops, det ser ut som att det inte finns någon giltig medlemskapsstatus tillgänglig för de angivna medlemsdatumen. Du kan <a href=\"%1\">Konfigurera medlemskapsstatusregler </a>."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"OR You can sign up by setting Status Override? to something other than "
"\"NO\"."
msgstr "ELLER du kan anmäla dig genom att ställa in Manuell status? till något annat än \"NEJ\"."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Membership Status Error"
msgstr "Fel vid medlemskapsstatus"

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Please enter the Member Since."
msgstr "Mata in 'Medlem sedan'"

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Please enter the Membership status."
msgstr "Vänligen ange medlemsstatus."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Please enter the Membership override end date."
msgstr "Vänligen ange medlemskapet överskrid slutdatum."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Please enter the contribution."
msgstr "Ange betalningen."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"Contribution submitted by a staff person using member's credit card for "
"signup"
msgstr "Betalning som lämnats in av en personal som använder medlems kreditkort för registrering"

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "A membership confirmation and receipt has been sent to %1."
msgstr "Bekräftelse och kvitto för medlemskap har skickats till %1."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"Associated recurring contribution cannot be updated on membership type "
"change."
msgstr "Associerat återkommande betalning kan inte uppdateras om ändring av medlemskapstyper."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Associated contribution is updated on membership type change."
msgstr "Associated betalning uppdateras om ändring av medlemskapstyper."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "Membership for %1 has been updated."
msgstr "Medlemskapet för %1 har uppdaterats."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "The Membership Expiration Date is %1."
msgstr "Utgångsdatum för medlemskapet är %1."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "%1 membership for %2 has been added."
msgstr "%1-medlemskap för %2 har lagts till."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "The new Membership Expiration Date is %1."
msgstr "Utgångsdatum för det nya medlemskapet är %1."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"The financial types associated with the old and new membership types are "
"different. You may want to edit the contribution associated with this "
"membership to adjust its financial type."
msgstr "De finansiella typerna som är förknippade med de gamla och nya medlemstyperna är olika. Du kanske vill redigera det betalning som är förknippat med detta medlemskap för att justera dess finansiella typ."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid ""
"The cost of the old and new membership types are different. You may want to "
"edit the contribution associated with this membership to adjust its amount."
msgstr "Kostnaden för de gamla och nya medlemstyperna är olika. Du kanske vill redigera betalningen i samband med detta medlemskap för att justera beloppet."

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "%1 Membership Signup: Credit card or direct debit (by %2)"
msgstr "%1 Medlemskapsregistrering: Kreditkort eller direktdebitering (genom %2)"

#: CRM/Member/Form/Membership.php
msgid "%1 Membership: Offline signup (by %2)"
msgstr "%1 Medlemskap: Offline-anmälan (av %2)"

